{"id":"meinerseits","lemma":"meinerseits","pos":"adv","rank":4569,"glosses":["for my part; on my part; with respect to me"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/29/De-meinerseits.ogg/De-meinerseits.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das war ein fehler meinerseits.","en":"That was an error on my part.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"fault, error, mistake"},null]},{"text":"Die Freude war ganz meinerseits.","en":"The pleasure was mine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756539","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"joy, delight, glee"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"entire"},null]},{"text":"Meinerseits kann ich keinen Unterschied erkennen.","en":"Personally, I can't see a difference.","words":[null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"difference"},{"g":"to recognize, perceive"}]},{"text":"Das Vergnügen ist ganz meinerseits.","en":"The pleasure's all mine.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"joy, pleasure"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"entire"},null]}]}